  "name": "Virtualization and Backup Forensics Pack",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "Method and tooling for the control plane of virtualization and backup: what hypervisor management records and VM configuration files say, whether a snapshot or disk chain is complete and which markers a consolidation or an unclean close may leave, what a backup catalogue, job record and retention setting show, and which recovery points survive. It reads exports and configuration files offline; it never runs hypervisor or backup software, reads no guest content, and supports only the products its tools list.",
